    BoxData["\"\<Debug\>\""], "InlineFormula",
     FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
     "36c19c85-764d-0b01-5efe-15ef03f8566b"]], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "6815cd54-0cd7-196f-182a-e51ea5626bb5"], Cell[
    "an association of the four counts", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "519775d4-d545-25f2-07ad-6c91dcf18fd8"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "5900aac7-5263-773e-0f3f-43a167165a04"], Cell[TextData[Cell[
    BoxData["\"\<All\>\""], "InlineFormula",
     FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
     "06ecfdb3-2197-c9b0-2e93-f4fd50239b9a"]], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "12d95fcb-3316-2212-42e7-569546a37178"], Cell[TextData[{
     "an association of the states, the events, the two relations and the \
four counts, with a ",
     Cell[BoxData["\"\<Warnings\>\""], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "733995c2-f5bf-78ee-22c6-0caffc4a4a34"],
     " key when the run warns"
    }], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"4f8ab258-7e7f-0723-7589-34027b0a6a09"]}
  }]], "2ColumnTableMod",
 CellID->2122865143,ExpressionUUID->"6b12ee74-9953-131d-1921-003e18e67e67"],

Cell["\<\
A list of properties gives an association keyed by the property names, \
computed from one evolution.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->1735808809,ExpressionUUID->"65262d3c-fccc-1dc6-0cdd-c579f579672c"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Any graph property takes the suffix ",
 Cell[BoxData["Structure"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5e157ee2-48da-d240-062b-77cc696ca0aa"],
 ". A styled graph draws each state as its hypergraph and each event as a box \
showing the edges it consumed and produced, with the record of each vertex \
and edge as a tooltip. In a ",
 Cell[BoxData["Structure"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "78287f93-0f12-7c52-2828-76ddaaa746b8"],
 " graph the state vertices are the state ids and the event vertices are ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"{", 
   RowBox[{"\"\<E\>\"", ",", " ", "id"}], "}"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "08285353-0e0e-39f8-3828-4b1dabb88bc2"],
 "; in the evolution graphs they are ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"{", 
   RowBox[{"\"\<S\>\"", ",", " ", "id"}], "}"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1daed7d3-93e8-7698-4b55-ce9d259d5ce2"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"{", 
   RowBox[{"\"\<E\>\"", ",", " ", "id"}], "}"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "187adc3d-3961-76c2-4819-d667b8145c28"],
 ". Every edge carries an association naming the event or the pair it stands \
for."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->753514147,ExpressionUUID->"641c78eb-7f03-7846-0c24-71b57ab64aac"],

Cell["A state record has the keys:", "Notes",
 CellID->1164297175,ExpressionUUID->"5bfcc75d-c21d-6fb0-0983-df06f7a8359a"],

Cell[BoxData[GridBox[{
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "112ae6ec-4b5c-6ad2-4729-ffb66ee93838"], Cell["", "TableText",
     FontWeight->Bold,ExpressionUUID->"6121b9de-dddd-aca8-10de-309bd469f6f2"],
     Cell["", "TableText",
     FontWeight->Bold,ExpressionUUID->"30209679-023a-ee91-61df-0823b7ccb4fb"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "29bc1606-c22d-409d-5f43-8863f7d812e7"], Cell[TextData[Cell[
    BoxData["\"\<Id\>\""], "InlineFormula",
     FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
     "7bf1e1bf-5b3e-c64b-298e-f8f95ec8ac91"]], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "3119d855-3ffd-7401-6726-d21fb9885f6b"], Cell[
    "the state id", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "62a6d1b5-4e36-fa69-125d-c8ff6bc0c8b3"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "7c41cdc9-5ab3-1ef5-247e-e4935f4664df"], Cell[TextData[Cell[
    BoxData["\"\<CanonicalId\>\""], "InlineFormula",
     FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
     "51fce014-dca1-0630-0783-fa51d5546d1a"]], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "657c1c65-980e-511d-1303-964f19bb2067"], Cell[TextData[{
     "the id of the state's class under ",
     Cell[BoxData["\"\<CanonicalizeStates\>\""], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "0f15dbd5-5f35-596c-352a-d29f5ac02bb6"],
     "; its own id under ",
     Cell[BoxData["None"], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "7e9b7e66-629a-1114-26b9-7040172f607e"]
    }], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"585a51e6-774f-2dd2-087a-48c002fa7738"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "1d7c0b5b-c40c-ea6a-4b03-a304edbeb8b0"], Cell[TextData[Cell[
    BoxData["\"\<ContentStateId\>\""], "InlineFormula",
     FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
     "370294fd-9e49-2d35-5d31-0da71bfc741f"]], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "2845529c-454d-b13b-587b-4bc66cf90001"], Cell[
    "the lowest id of the states with the same edge list", "TableText",
     ExpressionUUID->"7519012f-e657-215b-2326-988893e273a1"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "594776df-9e75-d16a-0f7d-6f991b01a3b0"], Cell[TextData[Cell[
    BoxData["\"\<Step\>\""], "InlineFormula",
     FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
     "6405505f-4b92-3bd6-0c3b-4a196e24893c"]], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "6878c7f8-419e-9db5-1807-dea27028e79f"], Cell[
    "the step of the state", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "48a3d607-c312-9dd3-7850-c860f6a4e739"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "539491e8-328f-8d7b-01ab-08b2473bd441"], Cell[TextData[Cell[
    BoxData["\"\<Edges\>\""], "InlineFormula",
     FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
     "7fcf59b5-a5ca-2155-25f5-50fecc7f73bf"]], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "023f49e2-a747-9723-33c5-60cfd2f3fa09"], Cell[
    "the hyperedges, each as its edge id followed by its vertices", 
     "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"21aa1c49-e16c-f406-57a9-9612901edf6c"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "289b85cd-827f-9a9c-58b8-1c97370be8e6"], Cell[TextData[Cell[
    BoxData["\"\<IsInitial\>\""], "InlineFormula",
     FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
     "12f3dbee-abc4-6375-4280-d2cbce714e5f"]], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "7ed5da6f-a344-b859-26ea-dc48d6f60aa3"], Cell[
    "1 for an initial state, 0 otherwise", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "2cfa2c34-ef50-7d46-5499-c6718ae547ac"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "362a4e41-4988-041f-5e2a-602b683d6f65"], Cell[TextData[Cell[
    BoxData["\"\<CanonicalHash\>\""], "InlineFormula",
     FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
     "01ed6b92-5a5f-fa78-3792-82dc5febc942"]], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "107fa29c-d013-1000-4004-3bd9e1a6636a"], Cell[TextData[{
     "with ",
     Cell[BoxData[
      RowBox[{"\"\<IncludeCanonicalHashes\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "True"}]], 
      "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "6798df62-4cc7-e4e1-0da7-d74c6573cecb"],
     ", a hash equal for isomorphic states"
    }], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"49f5450b-e8d1-97dd-7f8b-5d548965fd27"]}
  }]], "2ColumnTableMod",
 CellID->632614636,ExpressionUUID->"2570a8a5-7a6f-59e7-530f-410f7f1a2bcd"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "An event record has the keys ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<Id\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "0b990c23-b656-01a6-39a6-a58cc3e3538c"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<CanonicalId\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "52243646-2fbd-210e-03db-a8204a487054"],
 " (the event's identity under ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<CanonicalizeEvents\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1acd7f4d-3da3-7753-4af3-7717b4565db9"],
 "; its own id under ",
 Cell[BoxData["None"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "062d91f0-6326-41c0-2fd2-08ba16d3132a"],
 "), ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<RuleIndex\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1ac7f74a-ce09-be58-4afc-ef17ebbd04a2"],
 " (the position of the rule that fired, counted from 0), ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<InputState\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6f6ad260-8ee1-565a-1569-d44a2a943ca0"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<OutputState\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "612fd791-c81e-86f2-10d4-cedae9a8ecd8"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<CanonicalInputState\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "26dca2d1-2715-746d-4ee3-3b9b52a05eb7"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<CanonicalOutputState\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "296a77cd-8fa3-dd44-5f6a-6e972a57a7ae"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<ConsumedEdges\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6b853673-18d0-d9fa-19ba-a83d996aabc0"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<ProducedEdges\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "25b5b884-ef74-61b3-534a-31e18a013399"],
 " (edge ids)."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->1689610856,ExpressionUUID->"574a2197-51ef-7938-7d49-b8d1679a4802"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "A causal record has the keys ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<From\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6e85e9ed-427b-8528-16ba-00b7770fec72"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<To\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "73b76025-96bb-3fff-214d-798f234f85c5"],
 " (the producer and consumer events under the event identity in use) and ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<RawFrom\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "31f4c073-8ff6-126f-678b-da3d298360b5"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<RawTo\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "72ff7667-e560-b2c0-2285-68408c1a002a"],
 " (the same pair as the ids of the individual applications). A branchial \
record has the keys ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<From\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7c9be80e-0554-61c1-24b8-0268ace1332b"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<To\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "106b7ad8-6378-599b-4069-7382160d2be1"],
 "."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->1303163127,ExpressionUUID->"7e6f7c7a-fa8f-2da1-2615-7627ff3a778b"],

Cell["\<\
The engine numbers the vertices of a state from 0 in order of first \
appearance, and hyperedges from 0 in order of creation. State and event ids \
are assigned in the order the engine creates them, which can differ between \
two evolutions of the same input, so ids are only meaningful within one \
result.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->2098230307,ExpressionUUID->"304452a4-201b-d64c-607c-4b0e51afbc96"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Two events are causally related when one consumes a hyperedge the other \
produced. The causal relation is transitively reduced by default. ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<NumCausalEdges\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6beff1f8-c64a-83a6-1994-e8a5f3fcd18c"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<CausalEdges\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "4b5b9263-9199-4e16-7978-144d202c157c"],
 " and the causal graphs give the same relation."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->1930159659,ExpressionUUID->"475d7054-346c-a3cc-6d63-6a1ebd1ef116"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Two events are branchially related when they are applied to the same state \
and consume a common hyperedge. ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<BranchialEdges\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2ef71510-aa09-eca9-568c-8d5dcfbdb6f3"],
 " lists every such pair; the branchial graph joins the output states of the \
pairs at the step ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<BranchialStep\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3343f580-98d5-e31c-6170-ecea1961ce66"],
 " selects."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->1113655915,ExpressionUUID->"20a7420b-376a-b23f-505d-6455421c0105"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "A ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<StepStatistics\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6af863a9-1098-c609-1a98-7af3a112ad53"],
 " entry has the keys ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<Step\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "055bc2ad-6b92-a3be-3378-dbf70e24f184"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<RawStates\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2b0fb60e-2211-365f-5934-286857a59ca5"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<Classes\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "201a2509-bdd9-2fa1-5039-bd53346c758b"],
 " (isomorphism classes), ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<Redundancy\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7085d256-6adc-aa08-20ba-d4100f6ef952"],
 " (states per class), ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<MaxMultiplicity\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5f932952-49a5-d34f-05a0-c11c6851a195"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<MultiplicityHistogram\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "160f17c4-d31a-fe19-3e34-8ea1e6acc563"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<ClassEntropyBits\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "10beb8bd-bdb6-ee93-4045-31e73440b4f9"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<ClassEntropyNormalized\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3fdc991b-fead-14b0-65e3-1144fb587e9a"],
 " (the entropy of the states over the classes), ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<Events\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3657d2c5-05c0-ac85-5e6c-cbafac7af6ef"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<RuleCounts\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "0642d375-09f3-9942-2e71-cb3faf87eba8"],
 " (the events whose output state is at the step), ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<Invariants\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "0651775d-2bad-791b-2e6f-6f074e584861"],
 " (for each of eleven per-state invariants, such as ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<VertexCount\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "63b9e3d6-2298-231e-1146-fa9057128e64"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<Components\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "67c13665-f813-2f11-0dfe-a84ef9a6727b"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<IncidenceDiameter\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "4c440104-ea8a-4285-747b-99618f3f10ef"],
 ", its ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<N\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "66c9a615-af45-c085-0ef6-385ecaf192ef"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<Mean\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "0513e607-0f4c-1e20-3320-f861aaf9650a"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<StandardDeviation\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "0371ff35-cd30-cda2-310e-f77ee4ca9788"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<Min\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6833ae6a-6ac5-a2c8-19c0-40340f71f012"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<Max\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5f7f2999-1aee-25a5-0504-c0c39e988f8f"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<Median\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "128c7526-c883-085d-42b4-6c83e9365aa7"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<Histogram\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3279c00f-c9e2-8758-6206-da68ef94eda2"],
 "), and histograms of hyperedge arity and vertex degree. Under ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"\"\<ExploreFromCanonicalStatesOnly\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "True"}]],
   "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "50b12ff8-e606-85f7-004e-c6a593b0efdd"],
 " they are computed from one state per class and the number of states in the \
class."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->1606118752,ExpressionUUID->"640f47a5-4648-c62d-0c35-5e0f73e2ad77"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["HGEvolve"]], 
    "paclet:WolframInstitute/HypergraphRewriteEngine/ref/HGEvolve", 
    "WolframInstitute/HypergraphRewriteEngine Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "63a48922-0fac-666c-115b-208caa594cb6"],
 " takes every option of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["Graph"]], "paclet:ref/Graph"},
   "RefLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "387a9e0d-0234-0e73-6819-1057b7c15559"],
 " and passes it to the graph a graph property returns, so ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["ImageSize"]], "paclet:ref/ImageSize"},
   "RefLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "3f64ca0d-9927-5f44-651b-ec5718d225ae"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["AspectRatio"]], "paclet:ref/AspectRatio"},
   "RefLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "399d1ff3-4632-be92-6fa2-96bd73c404f8"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["VertexLabels"]], "paclet:ref/VertexLabels"},
   "RefLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "1170384d-2f38-2c50-470f-b2174acd76ba"],
 " or ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["GraphLayout"]], "paclet:ref/GraphLayout"},
   "RefLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "6ce33075-6d34-44a7-1490-aa3f04c12e8d"],
 " change the picture. A styled graph needs about 55 points of width for each \
state in its widest layer. The following options can also be given:"
}], "Notes",
 CellID->2141499446,ExpressionUUID->"54e2b6d5-0ba4-5b19-7c91-2f9fae512663"],

Cell[BoxData[GridBox[{
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "6334ac9c-43f1-85c0-12cb-45c67585ef2a"], Cell["", "TableText",
     FontWeight->Bold,ExpressionUUID->"74397683-04f4-1d4d-1dc7-6fedac816797"],
     Cell["", "TableText",
     FontWeight->Bold,ExpressionUUID->"735e49d5-32a1-4a48-2166-609f47541892"],
     Cell["", "TableText",
     FontWeight->Bold,ExpressionUUID->"335d55a2-cf9b-493d-6163-4c0fea2e1807"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "3bfbbd45-edb8-1b0b-6998-352e844d6651"], Cell[TextData[Cell[
    BoxData["\"\<CanonicalizeStates\>\""], "InlineFormula",
     FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
     "045023ab-c37d-b770-2c6f-baf4f6091a5a"]], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "73e8aeff-5b91-f8f4-2197-47b95e25cade"], Cell[TextData[Cell[BoxData[
    "None"], "InlineFormula",
     FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
     "33e490f1-5bc8-e939-619b-09bb5e62b803"]], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "794a4309-908b-2549-2f4a-5b53213f8f93"], Cell[TextData[{
