     " draws one edge per event or pair; ",
     Cell[BoxData["\"\<Merged\>\""], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "37161f66-4600-a3a8-5d2d-974073baf1f2"],
     " draws edges with the same endpoints as one edge"
    }], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"2e44757e-c407-f813-567c-6d3bedb3cb79"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "07a61755-6475-fbf7-2d5d-8f1f0d01c9dd"], Cell[TextData[Cell[
    BoxData["\"\<ShowProgress\>\""], "InlineFormula",
     FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
     "539b0e4e-9e5a-5525-01b8-a0281bef3c0f"]], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "1cd82739-42e3-b7ed-44e7-bf6376971d37"], Cell[TextData[Cell[BoxData[
    "False"], "InlineFormula",
     FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
     "0971a20b-7913-467e-3f0e-445578a62d44"]], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "09df342d-d743-5809-3fe4-ae76e2f62b53"], Cell[
    "whether to print the engine's progress", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "0a0cc1e9-e2ca-26d9-3a33-d8b2977c8c23"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "21fdaace-430e-f3f9-5782-43a876b8c1c3"], Cell[TextData[Cell[
    BoxData["\"\<DebugFFI\>\""], "InlineFormula",
     FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
     "1b4e2dea-4a49-bf2e-4975-c4b46ffd0274"]], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "10b057f0-cb39-4e6e-4040-4ebdeecc14b4"], Cell[TextData[Cell[BoxData[
    "False"], "InlineFormula",
     FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
     "41c6bfc6-0792-5005-77fd-36a0b227236f"]], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "62752e4e-571f-d961-120a-c02862aba84b"], Cell["\<\
whether to print what is requested from the engine and what it returns\
\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"34ee5221-bb14-cc46-5c96-4b8b3ea696ac"]}
  }]], "3ColumnTableMod",
 CellID->339082558,ExpressionUUID->"166277e1-e8de-815f-3e12-6eca8968d3a5"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<CanonicalizeStates\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "0ae7a534-7379-468c-3a9c-3d7e060c2cd6"],
 " is applied while the evolution runs, so it also determines which states \
are expanded. ",
 Cell[BoxData["Automatic"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "34baef30-7963-b757-5c59-077a78171dbd"],
 " identifies states whose edge lists are identical. This is finer than \
isomorphism: two isomorphic states with different vertex names stay separate. \
The vertices of each initial state are numbered from 0 separately, so two \
initial states that differ only in vertex names are one state under ",
 Cell[BoxData["Automatic"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "15ce0314-20ee-2b64-43f5-9b5e509b764e"],
 "."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->432388834,ExpressionUUID->"38a9ac88-4644-6c0e-6856-45d273f13754"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<CanonicalizeEvents\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "64802aa2-b136-451c-0cbf-c30fc0c32c66"],
 " builds an event's identity from isomorphism-invariant components. ",
 Cell[BoxData["Full"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "67771ff6-ea2e-a98b-0d0c-96b38fd8fbd1"],
 " uses the canonical input and output states. ",
 Cell[BoxData["Automatic"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "233ecb8e-17f3-8d32-52c5-e2e8a187d418"],
 " also uses the step and the canonical positions of the consumed and \
produced edges within the state's isomorphism class; it needs ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"\"\<CanonicalizeStates\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "Full"}]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7dd949a9-d8cf-50b3-2be7-60f2d97a2299"],
 ". ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<Positional\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "4a74bc9f-39f4-5114-7a0b-35d9bf81207e"],
 " uses the same components with positions read from each state's own vertex \
labels, as the Wolfram Multicomputation paclet does. A list of any of ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<InputState\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "598f41e5-f1df-a461-0fb5-58ce806b0f4b"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<OutputState\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1e0f0df5-2071-c96f-4634-a4bf51059bb5"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<Step\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7f6e12d5-e3b9-0bb9-2515-8b9e964c5983"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<Rule\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "41ecc127-3c02-05fa-7793-d881b5b76fc0"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<ConsumedEdges\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1190ff72-a9fe-60f8-47af-f73fcf8b32c2"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<ProducedEdges\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "19c80315-d7de-7125-4ff7-9b5ee26b400f"],
 " selects the components."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->443736588,ExpressionUUID->"6fdf78a7-59a9-97d9-15e5-7101585dfd23"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "With ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"\"\<ExploreFromCanonicalStatesOnly\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "True"}]],
   "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7a87483f-bfa4-2eb6-2abd-62793a51749c"],
 ", every property is the same as under full exploration; only the cost of \
the evolution changes. It needs ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"\"\<CanonicalizeStates\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "Full"}]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "09b26917-59e6-8729-3f41-81515f90ea73"],
 "."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->1593449978,ExpressionUUID->"521ad179-838d-ce9b-0239-c923363994e1"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<MaxSuccessorStatesPerParent\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "136d7364-bcfb-8461-4113-6b4e348fef4b"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<MaxStatesPerStep\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2b78534b-7a52-d624-5918-4b157fe4bd0e"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<UniformRandom\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "30c454b2-bdb8-e427-60fc-4dfc3432cf0d"],
 " with ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<MatchesPerStep\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6879dfe8-0276-0c7b-1806-d6b2b7035741"],
 " cap by arrival order. The bound holds at any thread count, and which \
states are kept depends on the thread schedule. ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<TransitionRate\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7cc522fa-6a93-e579-24fa-bba40f27cc43"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<ExplorationProbability\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5b82e386-6ff5-c0ee-09b1-fae009819234"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<MatchesPerStateRule\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "34a39a2f-b372-ffce-5c50-1388c604c514"],
 " draw from the identity of each transition or state together with ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<RandomSeed\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "66ca9132-7812-8248-0ec9-097c79a4d092"],
 ", so the same seed keeps the same states at any thread count and on either \
device."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->1742646261,ExpressionUUID->"023b1c4a-5b09-a8c9-33d8-96145ebdfa13"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<TransitionRate\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "29a4f364-fd74-7ca4-5f5b-eb41f401468e"],
 " keeps a state's lowest-keyed transition when every draw at that state \
failed, so a sparse sample reaches the requested depth. ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<ExplorationProbability\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "47740231-7fc8-4299-6d0b-a47b7a7d10e3"],
 " does not."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->29467524,ExpressionUUID->"1af52337-5e42-c8c3-4a8a-bb715bf49a29"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "A run that sets no ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<RandomSeed\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2fdb82dc-2353-e9b3-55f8-1b8656e7bb99"],
 " and discards states through an arrival-order cap, ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<ExplorationProbability\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5782d92f-a790-094a-7db1-d088d2255b90"],
 " or ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<TransitionRate\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "05d48452-325d-a277-33eb-1e1c47e9f15d"],
 " issues the message ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"HGEvolve", "::", "warn"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "087ffcf6-194e-431e-3804-f5b098fb2e64"],
 ", and its result can differ from run to run. ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<MatchesPerStateRule\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "615fadf7-df9a-5675-1764-44b0da2f3d5f"],
 " keeps the same transitions with or without a seed and issues no warning."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->1939141443,ExpressionUUID->"5de452e3-5fd7-a751-0b9c-4bcd5a630dbb"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"\"\<TargetDevice\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "\"\<GPU\>\""}]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2d0df906-1ebb-1081-5b32-f1609b4e62eb"],
 " runs the evolution on the GPU engine bundled for the platform, which gives \
the same states, events and relations as the CPU. Where no GPU engine is \
bundled, the message ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"HGEvolve", "::", "gpudev"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "519a4e0d-3467-bfb9-07ba-6057bd130583"],
 " is issued and the evolution runs on the CPU. A GPU evolution that reaches \
a capacity limit issues ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"HGEvolve", "::", "overflow"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3a891815-8c00-cf41-6ab6-925f25ba95ab"],
 " and gives a partial result."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->5047578,ExpressionUUID->"0dbacffa-31b0-43f6-3b59-e6a4404511dc"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "A generated initial condition is named by ",
 StyleBox["init", "TI"],
 ": ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<Grid\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "196a859c-b643-c1b3-4f69-1cd9c3f79399"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<Cylinder\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "48c8a383-1e42-ef31-78f7-3aed9bf4b21b"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<Torus\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "50735439-04fd-dee7-0001-4e63ac89a4cd"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<Sphere\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3597ba8d-914b-928f-63ac-33d720ffe0d5"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<Klein\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "056fda38-a5bc-2884-3314-dc65cc497aee"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<Mobius\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "383c4a9f-130c-f8c1-69c4-63d9a6beca2b"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<Sprinkling\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7b649e79-a2e1-7610-291b-1022d6945d7a"],
 " (also ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<Minkowski\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "09cb884c-5fc8-b209-3fc8-22165a620153"],
 "), ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<BrillLindquist\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "376c6589-bcca-29e8-5d14-7cd3357f7b32"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<Poisson\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "667bb688-7420-22c7-0e18-2fd27dd5702d"],
 " or ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<Uniform\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "72002252-da4c-5210-223f-c41fdff9217a"],
 ". The same names go in the ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<Type\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "084561a7-5440-aaee-387b-78015dfaf834"],
 " key of an association, where the other keys shape the instance and take \
precedence over the options below."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->15008895,ExpressionUUID->"721e71e5-9ca7-ded5-2226-68cf1553a43f"],

Cell["The initial-condition options are:", "Notes",
 CellID->1892712309,ExpressionUUID->"0a84e7eb-55e0-1894-3abb-feb563956afe"],

