Cell["\<\
Every state reached by a different history is a separate state, so the number \
of states grows quickly with the number of steps:\
\>", "ExampleText",
 CellID->945433024,ExpressionUUID->"136212ad-a4c2-b9f3-4111-8bf6cd740bd9"],

