 "With ",
 Cell[BoxData["True"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5028993e-6f44-360e-01d7-11780af69d54"],
 ", each isomorphism class is expanded once, at its shortest depth, instead \
of once for each of its states; the setting needs ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"\"\<CanonicalizeStates\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "Full"}]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "05297336-3344-a7f5-2cd7-6b7046f60ddf"],
