  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "52d3365b-85bc-1911-02e0-a8052c49687b"],
 ", they are computed from the number of states in each class, without \
building the individual events. Twenty steps of the chain rule:"
}], "ExampleText",
