Cell["\<\
It is also the seed of a generated initial condition. Another seed places six \
sprinkled points elsewhere:\
\>", "ExampleText",
 CellID->290695803,ExpressionUUID->"4897ab63-07fe-7036-78ac-434db18b431c"],

